  "text": "proprium.dominica-in-albis-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Low Sunday” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Receive, O Lord, we beseech Thee, the gifts of Thy rejoicing Church; and as Thou hast given her cause for so great a joy, grant her the fruit of everlasting gladness. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, Who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
